  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Squamous cell carcinoma of the right tonsillar pillar, p16-negative, suspected at presentation and confirmed by biopsy at the otolaryngology visit; linked to the documented 1885 diagnosis</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>C09.1</td><td>S — Synthetic diagnosis in the modern episode; the 1884-1885 findings remain D.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
    <td>Nicotine dependence, cigars, about ten a day for more than forty years</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>F17.290</td><td>S — Synthetic modern diagnosis linked to documented heavy cigar smoking.</td>
  </tr>
